{"4350110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bullet Time Agent", "steam_appid": 4350110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/52a27c4667e61bde40615e3562229f74.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/52a27c4667e61bde40615e3562229f74.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/52a27c4667e61bde40615e3562229f74.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BULLET TIME AGENT</strong> is a singleplayer, sci-fi action-adventure bullet hell playable in <strong>VR and non-VR (desktop)</strong> modes. Harness the mysterious Time Essence to slow time as you escape the sinister corporate facility, full of endless swarms of security bots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIME IS ON YOUR SIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive storms of bullets as you battle your way through robot-filled arenas. Use your Time Essence wisely to dodge enemy fire and deliver <strong>punch</strong> after satisfying <strong>punch</strong> to the endless security forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/03eb7f45e34b4c11dc5406fc243ef096.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/03eb7f45e34b4c11dc5406fc243ef096.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/03eb7f45e34b4c11dc5406fc243ef096.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERCOME IMPOSSIBLE ODDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear arenas full of <strong>bullets, lasers, and hazards</strong> with super-powered jumps, quick thinking, and smart <i>time management</i>. Level up your abilities to tackle the next area, with even more treacherous environments, cryptic puzzle locks, and more complex enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/d464101ee064a615863409fcb752ec62.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/d464101ee064a615863409fcb752ec62.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/d464101ee064a615863409fcb752ec62.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT ULTIMATE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore and collect more <strong>secrets</strong> and <strong>upgrades</strong>, you face increasingly difficult encounters that take strategy, persistence, and skill. Battle against <strong>elite bosses</strong> that will have you sweating as your limited Time Essence counts down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/cdcd0c60f138c731d238178368f37fff.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/cdcd0c60f138c731d238178368f37fff.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/cdcd0c60f138c731d238178368f37fff.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH CANNOT STOP YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time bends for you, but not your enemies!  <strong>Rewind time</strong> and return to battle, but every robot you destroy stays down until the battlefield is nothing but scrap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/ec9d75d576a7a393fcc451b8395e48bd.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/ec9d75d576a7a393fcc451b8395e48bd.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/ec9d75d576a7a393fcc451b8395e48bd.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>BULLET TIME AGENT</strong> is fast-paced action, with detailed cyberpunk sci-fi environments, an energizing soundtrack, and exhilirating challenges. <strong>Wishlist now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/52a27c4667e61bde40615e3562229f74.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/52a27c4667e61bde40615e3562229f74.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta