/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/d464101ee064a615863409fcb752ec62.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/d464101ee064a615863409fcb752ec62.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/d464101ee064a615863409fcb752ec62.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT ULTIMATE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore and collect more <strong>secrets</strong> and <strong>upgrades</strong>, you face increasingly difficult encounters that take strategy, persistence, and skill. Battle against <strong>elite bosses</strong> that will have you sweating as your limited Time Essence counts down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/cdcd0c60f138c731d238178368f37fff.poster.avif?t=1780973247\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/cdcd0c60f138c731d238178368f37fff.webm?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extras/cdcd0c60f138c731d238178368f37fff.mp4?t=1780973247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH CANNOT STOP YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time bends for you, but not your enemies!  <strong>Rewind time</strong> and return to battle, but every robot you destroy stays down until the battlefield is nothing but scrap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350110/extra